\p{
I am a PhD candidate at the [[ntnu]], doing work in higher category theory and
univalent type theory, supervised by [[runehaugseng]] and co-supervised by
[[ulrikbuchholtz]]. I am a collaborator on the [[agda-synthetic-categories]] project
and a maintainer of [[agda-unimath]].
}

\p{
Below you can find notes I've written for this web site, as well as pointers to my
other works. This page is written using [Jon Sterling](jonsterling)'s
[Forester](https://www.forester-notes.org/005P/), and it is hosted on a
[public GitHub repository](https://github.com/fredrik-bakke/forest).
}

